{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_04_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_04",
  "title": "污点证人",
  "storyCode": "GT-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2c462bcf160e5e2cfde6759cfd917bf034f360deefb35fae3c9ba58e9d6aba8e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）\n晴 \\ 能见度 14公里\n塔拉特山坑道"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "进了这个坑道就安全了。前面出去就是莫蒂卡山，从那里开始赏金猎人的数量会明显减少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于斯卡蒂————以前听到其他人把她形容成山崩，我一直都笑得很大声。结果我今天才见识到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本来以为只是一个比一般人强一点点的家伙，真没想到那些风言风语竟然不是在开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难怪在酒吧里，我笑的时候他们都一脸惊恐地看着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在轮到我惊恐了，哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "是真的！在罗德岛的时候，大家也都是这么传来传去的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我也没和她一起出过任务，只知道她很厉害就是了，根本没想到会变成今天这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我是头次知道她是赏金猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赏金猎人中的大明星之一了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这次，就连她也是冲着宝藏来的，就真的太麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们两个能不能从她嘴里抢到一成，都很难说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那样的话，我的村子岂不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别担心，我觉得她会赶走所有赏金猎人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顺带，再毁掉几个村子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我觉得她并不是冲着宝藏来的，我不能让这种事发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，你们这个什么罗德岛，收人也是来者不拒啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "没有一个罗德岛干员会为了私人的利益，去毫无顾忌地伤害别人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，你帮过我，谢谢你。但是你们罗德岛又养着斯卡蒂这种只懂得破坏的灾星，我看也未必真的是为感染者好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，我一个得了矿石病的人，也没见你们罗德岛做了啥能给我们好处的事，还不是四处被人追打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "鲍勃大叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么，哑口无言了？我是不知道你到底相信你们那个罗德岛什么地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "照我看来，嘴上说着为感染者争取这个那个的，到头来，都是见钱眼开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，什么罗德岛，在这个世上，再没有比我手上这个小小金币更重要的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱什么歉？你还是个小孩子，弄不清理想和现实的年纪，不知道自己究竟几斤几两，这无所谓，都很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不，我不是要说这个。我知道自己的力量还不足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "不管是作为骑警，还是作为罗德岛干员，我都接触过很多感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "......我没能救下他们所有人，这都是我力量还不足的缘故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "罗德岛也是一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也就是没什么用？哈!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是，感染者们在地下城里受苦的时候，被关进隔离城区，被人无端杀害的时候，罗德岛人在哪儿呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我也好，罗德岛也好，就算有时候拼劲全力，也总有力不能及的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "但就算这样，我依然不会放弃任何一位我见到的无辜感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "罗德岛，也是一样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "抱歉......鲍勃大叔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我说了，你还是个小孩子，我刁难你有什么用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可那个斯卡蒂，你的同事，现在不惜对你刀剑相向也要抓走可萝尔夺走宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你肯定这种人也会相信你们拯救感染者那一套，甚至去帮你们做这种事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "我还不了解斯卡蒂究竟想做什么，所以我不能在这里下结论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "但我相信，罗德岛接受了她，她肯定也有自己的理由才这样做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刚才话太多了，你忘了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "总之当务之急，果然还是要快点帮可萝尔小姐拿到宝藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我伤了腿，已经是你们的累赘了。真没想到我居然要拖两个小姑娘的后腿，呿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "鲍勃大叔，只有一种情况会让你拖累我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "那就是你不想把宝藏给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲍勃先生，我没有嫌恶你的意思，只是我刚才......还是有些害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是个乡下人，没有亲眼见过感染者，但我多少还是能看出来......你是有苦衷的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我之前有什么冒犯的地方，请见谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没关系。哈，小姑娘，你只要在拿到宝藏后，付给我我需要的那份报酬就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......宝藏对我们村子来说很重要。但只要能解决我们的问题，鲍勃先生是一定可以拿到应有的酬劳的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，我和格拉尼，既需要你的协助，也会帮助你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对吧，格拉尼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "那当然。不管怎么样，我们也该动身了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姑娘，下个目标地点，差不多是莫蒂卡山了吧，那座山的名字，是某个死了不知道多少年的骑士的封号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我没猜错，这个什么骑士宝藏，就是在那里吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可上面的洞窟也够找上好几个星期了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那当然了。所以没有你，不行。我们可不会把你交给那个红眼女啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就麻烦你带路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就这么办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_010",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出口有动静——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“上尉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁......救救......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“上尉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是......感染......者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动A",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": ".......你下手那么重？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动B",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我什么都没做呀，他自己跌倒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动B",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动A",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
